  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Project for Pari and Baruni villages in the Motu Koita Area.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Water Project is to address the long-standing water supply issues faced by the Motu Koita villages of Pari and Baruni in Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea. The project seeks to ensure that the indigenous women and children of Port Moresby, have sufficient access to clean water by installing water tanks and pumps, thereby alleviating the burden of water collection.</narrative>
  </description>
